# The per-park-day backtest frame: ~300 KB, regenerated in 40 s by
# `python -m forecast.cli backtest`, and the only file in forecast/results/ that no
# figure and no prose reads — every other one is under 8 KB and feeds a chart. The
# rule for that directory is: commit what is consumed, ignore what is regenerable
# and unconsumed.
forecast/results/backtest_days.csv
